  "design": {
    "idea": "The Sundial Chandelier (Grand Island 4 Synthesis): turn the Weather Wheel to WIND to wake the updrafts, glide across, aim the Blue Transformer east through the Shadow Gate into the Canopy Seal sensor, hang your lantern behind the west baffle so the Shadow Gate opens dark, and turn the wheel to SUN so the skylight beam bounces blue through the dark gate and shatters the Canopy Seal!",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ketsu",
    "teaches": "Synthesizing Weather Wheel, Blue Transformer, Shadow Gate, Lantern Hook, Updraft Vent, and Moth Wings in one grand optical contraption",
    "decisions": 13,
    "expert_s": 75,
    "reward": "c4_canopy_seal, 50 shards",
    "why": "Grand Island 4 synthesis climax puzzle guarding the Bellfry Loft vista.",
